	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TI RNQ0040A WQFN-40, 6.0x4.0mm body, 0.4mm pitch, 0.8mm max height. Land pattern drawn from the datasheet EXAMPLE BOARD LAYOUT (SLLSF47D rev April 2024, p.66): 40x 0.6x0.2mm pads, ring extents 5.8x3.8mm, exposed pad 4.7x2.7mm. WARNING: the exposed pad is the ONLY ground connection on this part - there is no GND pin. It must be soldered and stitched (TI shows 9x 0.2mm vias); pad 41 carries GND. 3D MODEL IS A STAND-IN: KiCad QFN-38-1EP_4x6mm_P0.4mm (correct 6.0x4.0x0.78mm envelope and 0.4mm pitch, but 38 terminals instead of 40, and its pin-1 index dot does not line up with pin 1). Good for enclosure and height checks, not for terminal-level inspection.")
	(tags "WQFN-40 QFN TI RNQ TUSB1044 redriver C2873603")
